## API (auth / subscription)

| Endpoint | Handler |
|----------|---------|
| `GET /memberships` | `membership.controller.ts` |
| `POST /auth/register-organization` | `auth.controller.ts` — provisions org-only trial |
| `POST /auth/switch-organization` | `membership.controller.ts` |
| `GET /v1/subscription/me` | `subscription.controller.ts` — satelliteEntitlements, connectableSatellites |
| `POST /v1/subscription/connect-satellite` | `subscription.controller.ts` — owner Connect |
| `POST /v1/billing/toggle-module` | `billing.controller.ts` — owner module enable/disable |
| `GET /v1/billing/module-states` | `billing.controller.ts` — pending deactivation flags |
| `GET /v1/admin/mdm/companies` | `admin-mdm.controller.ts` — legal entities (name decrypt + org fallback) |
| `GET /v1/admin/organizations/:id/subscription-tree` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |
| `PATCH /v1/admin/config/trial-allowlist` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |
| `POST /v1/admin/organizations/:id/connect-preset/sanatorium` | `admin-billing.controller.ts` |

## Platform catalog gateway (API — industry satellites)

Auth: `Authorization: Bearer` (`SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN` or `CONTROL_PLANE_SERVICE_TOKEN`) + `X-Organization-Id`. Entitlement: `platform_reference_data` (skip locally: `REFERENCE_DATA_SKIP_ENTITLEMENT=1`). Proxies to data-hub `/registry/v1/*`.

| Endpoint | Handler |
|----------|---------|
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/day` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/days` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/is-working-day` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/calendar/:country/add-business-days` | `catalog-calendar.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/catalog/fx/convert` | `catalog-fx.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/workforce/policy` | `workforce-policy.controller.ts` |
| `GET/POST /platform/v1/workforce/employments` | `workforce-employments.controller.ts` |
| `GET/POST/PATCH /platform/v1/workforce/absences/*` | `workforce-absences.controller.ts` |
| `GET/POST/PATCH /platform/v1/workforce/vacation-plans/*` | `workforce-vacation-plans.controller.ts` — department submit → HR approve; event `WORKFORCE_VACATION_PLAN_APPROVED` (Finance mirror HEADLESS — no local table yet) |
| `GET/POST /platform/v1/workforce/personnel-orders/*` | hire/transfer/terminate printable orders + PDF — [ADR cp-personnel-orders](../../../docs/adr/cp-personnel-orders.md) |
| `GET/POST /platform/v1/workforce/staff-schedule/*` | ştat cədvəli revisions (occupied/vacant snapshot) + approve + PDF |
| `GET/POST /platform/v1/workforce/scope/*` | `workforce-org.controller.ts` |
| `GET/POST/PATCH/POST archive /platform/v1/workforce/org-units/*` | `workforce-org-units.service.ts` + controller |
| `GET/POST/PATCH /platform/v1/workforce/positions/*` | `workforce-positions.controller.ts` |
| `PATCH /platform/v1/workforce/employments/:id/reprovision` | `workforce-provision.service.ts` |
| `GET/PUT/DELETE /platform/v1/workforce/role-templates/*` | `workforce-role-templates.controller.ts` |
| `GET/POST /platform/v1/workforce/manual-grants/*` | `workforce-manual-grants.controller.ts` |
| `GET /platform/v1/workforce/security/*` | `workforce-security.controller.ts` |
| Web `/workspace/workforce/security` | `apps/web/app/workspace/workforce/security/page.tsx` |
| Web `/workspace/workforce/org-structure` | `apps/web/app/workspace/workforce/org-structure/page.tsx` |
| Web `/workspace/workforce/positions` | `apps/web/app/workspace/workforce/positions/page.tsx` |
| Web `/workspace/workforce/employments` | `apps/web/app/workspace/workforce/employments/page.tsx` |
| Web `/workspace/workforce/absences` (+ `/new`, `/[id]`) | `apps/web/app/workspace/workforce/absences/` |
| BFF `/api/platform/workforce/*` | `apps/web/app/api/platform/workforce/[[...path]]/route.ts` |
| BFF `/api/platform/mdm/workforce/*` | `apps/web/app/api/platform/mdm/workforce/[[...path]]/route.ts` |
| `POST /internal/v1/mdm/persons/ops-profile/batch` | `mdm.controller.ts` — workforce batch display (+ `hrProfile` when grant allows) |
| `GET/PATCH /internal/v1/mdm/persons/:id/hr-profile` | `mdm.controller.ts` — grant-gated PersonHrProfile + PersonAddress |
| `POST /internal/v1/mdm/persons/workforce-resolve` | `mdm.controller.ts` — hire intake |
| `POST /portal/v1/mdm/access/session` | `mdm-consent-portal.controller.ts` |
| `GET /portal/v1/mdm/access/requests` | `mdm-consent-portal.controller.ts` |
| `POST /portal/v1/mdm/access/requests/:id/decide` | `mdm-consent-portal.controller.ts` |

Module: `platform/catalog/catalog-gateway.module.ts`. Client in satellites: `@era/satellite-kit` `platform-catalog.client.ts`.

